The '''Barter Bank Show''' was a sub-location of the {{zone|Village Plaza}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. It was removed upon the closing of the Alpha network once testing for the Rift had been completed.

== Features ==
The '''Barter Bank Show''' featured a few attractions.

=== Cashier ===
{{Main|Cashier}}
The [[Cashier]] was an [[NPC]] located in the '''Barter Bank Show'''. The player could talk to them to trade {{Motes|10,000}} for {{Yellow|20M NotCoins}}, a currency exclusive to the Barter Bank Show.

=== Barter Bank Show ===
Despite never being released, the '''Barter Bank Show''' contained two [[NPCs]] which hinted at a game show. The game could have been started by talking to the [[Game Agent]], and {{Gold|10}} chests would appear, containing unique amounts of {{Yellow|NotCoins}}. The goal would have been for the player to sell their chest for as much as possible to {{Gold|The Merchant}}, an unknown character.

The steps were as follows:{{TextSection|boxed=true|text={{Gold|'''1.'''}} Pick YOUR chest.<br>{{Gold|'''2.'''}} Open 3 chests.<br>{{Gold|'''3.'''}} Receive OFFER from {{Gold|The Merchant}}.<br>{{Gold|'''3.5.'''}} {{Green|Accept}} or {{Red|Decline}} the offer.<br>{{Gold|'''4.'''}} Open more chests, get more offers...<br>{{Gold|'''5.'''}} If all offers declined, open YOUR chest.}}

==Trivia==   
Despite never being released, the '''Barter Bank Show''' structure is still in the rift, near the [[Mirrorverse]] underground.

